# Acrolls acceptance fixture

This page deliberately keeps the core publication primitives together so a host build can
verify the complete article surface in one request.

## Code

```ts title="peer-state.ts"
type PeerState = 'idle' | 'connecting' | 'ready';

export function describePeer(state: PeerState) {
  return `peer is ${state}`;
}
```

